{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running an errand for an old friend inadvertently drags ex-gang leader Dan into a brutal smuggler war in a border town.<br>He\u2019ll pay any price to achieve his goal\u2014and make everyone else pay, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No mercy. No compromise. At any cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/499de51a20ec2756cabc619d74d2ff1c.poster.avif?t=1770914874\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/499de51a20ec2756cabc619d74d2ff1c.webm?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/499de51a20ec2756cabc619d74d2ff1c.mp4?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the shifting quicksand of narrative and gameplay. Unravel a web of interconnected events that lead Dan down a path he never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a9f3ff240cd9563f9cb1cc93540a911e.avif?t=1770914874\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.poster.avif?t=1770914874\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.webm?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.mp4?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large, dynamic levels</strong> offer tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters\u2014from luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break windows, slide across furniture, and use your skills to strike fast and clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch enemies off guard. Stay sharp. Return fire with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.poster.avif?t=1770914874\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.webm?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.mp4?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/3717851ea645cfce471801bc7463721d.avif?t=1770914874\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re taking you into a <strong>linear story with layered perception</strong>. The events remain the same, but your interpretation of them changes based on how you engage with the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.poster.avif?t=1770914874\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.webm?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.mp4?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to spend time talking\u2014or skip the chatter. The story will adapt to your depth of attention, transforming your experience from a gritty gangster thriller into something much deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 handcrafted, large-scale levels</strong>, each in a distinct location (no AI or procedural generation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole Wild West town for you to explore, full of stories and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original electronic soundtrack</strong>, rhythmically angry and composed exclusively for the game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474390?t=1770914874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/0f8d021e0afa31e5ef8573f7dba9acbeaa742926/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770914874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/aaaa116a63e79b57a007ebdce8fb3d68cdbfed63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770914874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/aaaa116a63e79b57a007ebdce8fb3d68cdbfed63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770914874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, Gun Violence, Strong language, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running an errand for an old friend inadvertently drags ex-gang leader Dan into a brutal smuggler war in a border town.<br>He\u2019ll pay any price to achieve his goal\u2014and make everyone else pay, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No mercy. No compromise. At any cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/499de51a20ec2756cabc619d74d2ff1c.poster.avif?t=1770914874\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/499de51a20ec2756cabc619d74d2ff1c.webm?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/499de51a20ec2756cabc619d74d2ff1c.mp4?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the shifting quicksand of narrative and gameplay. Unravel a web of interconnected events that lead Dan down a path he never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a9f3ff240cd9563f9cb1cc93540a911e.avif?t=1770914874\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.poster.avif?t=1770914874\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.webm?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.mp4?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large, dynamic levels</strong> offer tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters\u2014from luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break windows, slide across furniture, and use your skills to strike fast and clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch enemies off guard. Stay sharp. Return fire with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.poster.avif?t=1770914874\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.webm?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.mp4?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/3717851ea645cfce471801bc7463721d.avif?t=1770914874\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re taking you into a <strong>linear story with layered perception</strong>. The events remain the same, but your interpretation of them changes based on how you engage with the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.poster.avif?t=1770914874\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.webm?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.mp4?t=1770914874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to spend time talking\u2014or skip the chatter. The story will adapt to your depth of attention, transforming your experience from a gritty gangster thriller into something much deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 handcrafted, large-scale levels</strong>, each in a distinct location (no AI or procedural generation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole Wild West town for you to explore, full of stories and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original electronic soundtrack</strong>, rhythmically angry and composed exclusively for the game</p></li></ul>","developers":["Classified Office"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/63137bf309a128dd4330d96c3b913205412b2316/header.jpg?t=1770914874","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3474390/1578225013/c8a13c3abeaedeae92c9a4ed6801b165b4e41eff/1763650102/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763650304","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3474390/1578225013/c8a13c3abeaedeae92c9a4ed6801b165b4e41eff/1763650102/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763650304","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3474390/1578225013/c8a13c3abeaedeae92c9a4ed6801b165b4e41eff/1763650102/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763650304","id":257235280,"name":"Playtest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235280/b72e3b5fd8eb0b56ef5861ef6ce5125272ece928/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17636